# The forest snail's body (#329, D101, D106): the `dead` frame of snail.grid, pixel for pixel, the empty shell. Since #571
# (D117, the author, 2026-11-21) it keeps the live snail's palette, ink contour and moon rim, exactly as the `dead` frame:
# no decor recolour, no tint, no halo. The empty shell is the cue that it is dead (RemainsTest).
# Keep it in step with snail.grid: same keys, same colours.
size 24 16
color k 0b0814
color o b85a80
color s 4a0c22
color S 86101f
color t 9c2050
color c c87896
color m 2a0612
frame body
